cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software or the HACM-10 corpus, please cite the paper below.
title: "HA-ECN: Human-Aligned Epistemic Calibration Networks"
abstract: >-
  Code, corpus and trained models for the study of human-model confidence
  divergence under compound visual ambiguity. Defines HACM, a signed
  instance-level difference between model confidence and elicited human
  certainty, releases the HACM-10 corpus of 10,000 photographs carrying
  elicited confidence for 9,984 of them, and evaluates a three-module system
  built to reduce the divergence.
